<Base title="Privacy Policy | Calcloom" description="How Calcloom handles your data: calculators run in your browser and the numbers you enter are not stored.">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p>The numbers you enter into our calculators are processed in your browser and are not sent to or stored on our servers.</p>
  <p>We may use cookies and similar technologies for analytics and, once enabled, advertising by third parties such as Google AdSense. Google may use cookies to show ads based on your visits to this and other sites. You can manage ad personalisation at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com">adssettings.google.com</a>.</p>
  <p>This page will be updated when analytics or advertising is switched on.</p>
</Base>
